Z||000000||SLAMMED87GT||11-14-2001||01:24 PM||||Hi forum- To answer a few questions of yours. The 3" Drop, well, it might look like it wasn't lowered that much but it was. The fact that I am running 205/40 tires leaves some space in the wheel wells though, I plan on doing coil-overs in the rear though and I am keeping that size tire.<P>The clear tailights are the regular tails, with inserts taken out. I polished them and put colored bulbs in. I bought red glass bulbs generally used on imports at $10 a piece! Yes, they are more expensive but they look much better.<P>As for the front parking lights, they are back up lights from an '80s Cadillac. They fit pretty good, you have to modify them for them to fit though. I have Super-white bulbs instead of amber. I eventually am changinf my drving lights and head-light to Super-white as well.<P>Pic's of my previous Fieros and info are at:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/onegative_98" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/onegative_98</A> <P>It does not have many recent pics of my car though.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero9-01,1.jpg"> <BR>||||reg||10
